llustrations will be used for personal, nonprofit purposes only. Eg. SNS icon, profile image making.\nCredits will always be given. \n\n> Reference Images\nCurrently there's only few pieces of prototype chibi design of my character, which I created from a character maker (Commission reference usage is allowed in terms of use). Apologize for inconvinience.\nThus, you can appropriately simplify/modify the design if there's anything does not fit your painting style. Better not change her hair color and eye color.\n- https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PvpzOKb0ft1FFcWAqZPrKtqikwnK-rJg?usp=sharing\n\nI apologize for the lengthy message. I would appreciate it if you would consider my request.\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PvpzOKb0ft1FFcWAqZPrKtqikwnK-rJg?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ApricotLemonTea/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1148971, "client_id": 2053575, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/46eab1f8/uploads/origins/b8959923-cccc-4c9c-8917-c1c58795e323?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbf49e698a2307e6a99c66aba4cad1db", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/46eab1f8/uploads/origins/b8959923-cccc-4c9c-8917-c1c58795e323?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbf49e698a2307e6a99c66aba4cad1db, https://si.imgix.net/46eab1f8/uploads/origins/b8959923-cccc-4c9c-8917-c1c58795e323?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31f34194a1ad6fa2a773d4c9f424cb44 2x, https://si.imgix.net/46eab1f8/uploads/origins/b8959923-cccc-4c9c-8917-c1c58795e323?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ac71608f5884a131191d03f27758efc 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "